WEBVTT

00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:03.270
I wanna fight against you, no holds barred!

00:00:03.270 --> 00:00:06.440
That's how I'll settle my old score with you.

00:00:06.440 --> 00:00:10.180
Uh, I think you wanna say, "pay you back".

00:00:10.180 --> 00:00:11.940
I go first..

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:16.950
Once I am your foe, I'm gonna take 
you down with all I've got!

00:00:17.190 --> 00:00:20.290
These two teams made it...

00:00:20.290 --> 00:00:21.640
to the regional tournament finals!

00:00:21.640 --> 00:00:23.940
Making their debut, Team Quadrafolio!

00:00:23.940 --> 00:00:25.950
Q4, for short!

00:00:25.950 --> 00:00:28.210
Against them is the sure 
bet that you all know!

00:00:28.210 --> 00:00:30.350
Team Handsome!

00:00:30.350 --> 00:00:33.170
Which one will win?!

00:00:33.170 --> 00:00:36.230
Gouki, there's gonna be no holding back!

00:00:38.920 --> 00:00:40.640
I'm your opponent.

00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:41.770
Nagisa?!

00:00:42.340 --> 00:00:43.640
No way!

00:00:43.640 --> 00:00:46.650
If I win, we're getting married, okay?!

00:02:20.600 --> 00:02:22.570
The regional tournament finals!

00:02:22.570 --> 00:02:26.620
In the first match, Kamui Katsuragi 
versus Nagisa Daimonji!

00:02:26.620 --> 00:02:29.800
What kind of fight will they give us?!

00:02:29.800 --> 00:02:34.470
I'm sure these fighters, who have given 
us wonderful Vanguard fights so far...

00:02:34.470 --> 00:02:38.850
are eagerly anticipating 
feeding those brain cells now!

00:02:38.850 --> 00:02:42.500
Of course, we spectators should look 
forward to an entertaining fight...

00:02:42.500 --> 00:02:47.430
and a fair fight that leaves no regrets!

00:02:47.430 --> 00:02:49.660
Let's image!

00:02:49.660 --> 00:02:52.070
Let's Vanguard!

00:02:52.070 --> 00:02:54.290
Nagisa is going first...?

00:02:54.290 --> 00:02:55.400
Why...?

00:02:55.400 --> 00:02:56.740
It's nothing to be surprised about.

00:02:57.740 --> 00:02:59.670
Even if a person hasn't fought up until now,

00:02:59.670 --> 00:03:02.760
all they have to do is register as 
a player to be in the competition.

00:03:02.760 --> 00:03:04.440
It was the same with Tokura.

00:03:04.440 --> 00:03:05.600
I see...

00:03:06.690 --> 00:03:11.540
Gouki, we made a promise between 
men to fight each other!

00:03:11.780 --> 00:03:13.380
What is this?!

00:03:13.700 --> 00:03:15.030
True enough...

00:03:15.030 --> 00:03:19.360
But more important to me than being 
a man is being Nagisa's big brother.

00:03:19.360 --> 00:03:23.200
I can't refuse a request from my cute sister.

00:03:24.430 --> 00:03:26.260
Go ahead and laugh.

00:03:26.260 --> 00:03:28.250
But in the end, the winner's gonna be...

00:03:28.250 --> 00:03:29.300
love!

00:03:30.810 --> 00:03:32.950
That's right! Love!

00:03:32.950 --> 00:03:35.270
I don't care what you say!

00:03:35.690 --> 00:03:38.490
Excuse me, can we start the match...?

00:03:39.490 --> 00:03:43.510
Showdown! Nova Grappler

00:03:44.510 --> 00:03:48.530
In the first place, Nagisa, do you 
even know how to do a Vanguard fight?!

00:03:50.750 --> 00:03:55.180
Kamui, I'm more interested in watching 
you play Vanguard than playing myself!

00:03:57.380 --> 00:04:01.660
In fact, I've never seen you fight before!

00:04:01.660 --> 00:04:04.260
I learned!

00:04:04.260 --> 00:04:06.010
It's the power of love.

00:04:06.010 --> 00:04:09.560
Hear this story that brings tears to the 
eyes of both teller and listeners...

00:04:10.390 --> 00:04:16.020
Since the day you swore you'd beat Team 
Handsome and stopped comin' in to the card shop...

00:04:16.020 --> 00:04:19.020
Nagisa's been sufferin' from heartache!

00:04:19.020 --> 00:04:21.680
This is how big brother Gouki sees her!

00:04:21.680 --> 00:04:24.100
She's even cuter through his eyes, ka-boom!

00:04:24.100 --> 00:04:26.190
Don't interrupt!

00:04:26.190 --> 00:04:27.380
And so...

00:04:27.380 --> 00:04:31.840
One day, Nagisa asked me to teach 
her how to do a Vanguard fight.

00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:38.940
She thought, "If I can do a Vanguard 
fight, then maybe I can be with Kamui!"

00:04:38.940 --> 00:04:41.080
Struck by her pluck...

00:04:41.080 --> 00:04:43.720
I put Nagisa through a 
strict training regimen.

00:04:43.720 --> 00:04:47.500
"If I get strong, maybe 
Kamui will be pleased!"

00:04:49.110 --> 00:04:53.740
Ever moving forward, the power of love 
made Nagisa stronger and stronger!

00:04:53.740 --> 00:04:59.270
And finally, she progressed to the point of 
capturing a spot as a Team Handsome regular!

00:04:59.270 --> 00:05:00.480
Regular?!

00:05:00.480 --> 00:05:05.090
I wanted to cheer you on here, Kamui, 
so Hiroshi's been filling in for me!

00:05:06.230 --> 00:05:12.080
In other words, Team Handsome made it 
to the finals short one regular member?

00:05:12.290 --> 00:05:14.710
That girl's a regular!

00:05:14.710 --> 00:05:17.900
She must be pretty strong...

00:05:17.900 --> 00:05:22.190
Although I'm sure she's inferior 
to the Mighty Morikawa!

00:05:22.190 --> 00:05:25.890
I think you should save that kind of 
line until you're standing down there...

00:05:26.740 --> 00:05:28.090
Exactly!

00:05:28.090 --> 00:05:31.560
That's what I love about 
you, your extreme optimism!

00:05:34.300 --> 00:05:38.730
If Gouki is going along with it, 
then she must have the ability...

00:05:39.020 --> 00:05:40.960
Kamui, it's time for a showdown!

00:05:40.960 --> 00:05:43.980
Like I said before, if I 
win, we're getting married!

00:05:43.980 --> 00:05:45.920
I'm not agreeing to that!

00:05:45.920 --> 00:05:47.310
Don't you have confidence in yourself?

00:05:50.420 --> 00:05:51.940
Miss Emi...

00:05:59.150 --> 00:06:00.170
Emi...

00:06:00.170 --> 00:06:01.330
Darling!

00:06:04.100 --> 00:06:07.510
That's right! I'm gonna marry Miss Emi!

00:06:07.510 --> 00:06:09.810
All right! I accept your challenge!

00:06:09.810 --> 00:06:12.760
But if <i>I</i> win, you give up on me!

00:06:13.710 --> 00:06:16.950
I kind of feel sick to my stomach...

00:06:16.950 --> 00:06:18.190
I know what you mean!

00:06:19.160 --> 00:06:23.260
Maybe half the men in this 
hall feel the same way...

00:06:24.990 --> 00:06:26.150
You're on!

00:06:26.360 --> 00:06:30.490
With their lives on the line, those two 
are about to have a Vanguard fight!

00:06:30.490 --> 00:06:31.780
PW, yo!

00:06:31.780 --> 00:06:33.530
Please win, oh Great Kamui!

00:06:41.770 --> 00:06:43.660
Let the first match begin!

00:06:43.660 --> 00:06:45.940
Stand up, Vanguard!

00:06:50.760 --> 00:06:52.330
Battleriser?!

00:06:52.330 --> 00:06:54.740
You're not using the same 
Granblue deck as Gouki?!

00:06:54.740 --> 00:06:56.990
I wanted to use the same as you, Kamui!

00:06:58.310 --> 00:06:59.840
Anyway, here I go!

00:07:00.350 --> 00:07:03.120
I ride Tough Boy!

00:07:03.120 --> 00:07:06.170
I use Battleriser's skill 
to move to the rear-guard!

00:07:07.450 --> 00:07:08.820
That's the end of my turn.

00:07:10.250 --> 00:07:12.060
Here I go, Kamui!

00:07:13.860 --> 00:07:16.950
I ride Queen of Hearts!

00:07:19.590 --> 00:07:22.390
She even <i>sounds</i> like Kamui!

00:07:22.810 --> 00:07:28.040
Maybe those sweethearts are fighting 
and broke up just for this match...

00:07:29.490 --> 00:07:30.920
Hear that?

00:07:32.520 --> 00:07:35.830
Wrong! Nagisa and I are <i>not</i> sweethearts!

00:07:36.410 --> 00:07:37.640
Pipe down!

00:07:37.640 --> 00:07:39.700
The one that I love is...

00:07:39.700 --> 00:07:42.180
E...Em...you...

00:07:42.180 --> 00:07:44.250
Emu?

00:07:47.260 --> 00:07:50.520
I attack with my Queen, 
boosted by Battleriser!

00:07:50.520 --> 00:07:54.910
Battleriser's skill adds +3000 
to the power of the Queen!

00:07:56.580 --> 00:07:58.620
Drive trigger check!

00:07:59.130 --> 00:08:02.030
Yes! Critical trigger!

00:08:02.030 --> 00:08:03.980
That's +1 damage!

00:08:07.840 --> 00:08:09.600
Damage trigger check!

00:08:09.600 --> 00:08:10.740
One...

00:08:10.740 --> 00:08:11.800
Two...

00:08:14.020 --> 00:08:17.100
After boosting, Battleriser 
returns to the deck.

00:08:17.480 --> 00:08:19.730
It seems like you have a good 
understanding of the game.

00:08:19.730 --> 00:08:21.690
Of course! It's the power of love!

00:08:21.690 --> 00:08:23.960
It's my turn!

00:08:23.960 --> 00:08:26.750
I ride Genocide Jack!

00:08:31.210 --> 00:08:32.930
Battleriser moves forward!

00:08:32.930 --> 00:08:35.030
I call Cray Soldier! {or is it Cray Soldier? Can't find it, new card?}

00:08:35.570 --> 00:08:39.090
And then I call the King 
of Swords and Shining Lady!

00:08:43.370 --> 00:08:46.010
Here I go, Counter...

00:08:45.010 --> 00:08:46.010
...blast!

00:08:47.250 --> 00:08:48.210
Right?

00:08:48.210 --> 00:08:51.240
Yeesh! I'm no match for her 
when it comes to being a pest!

00:08:51.240 --> 00:08:52.130
Anyway...

00:08:52.130 --> 00:08:54.340
Genocide Jack is revved up to full speed!

00:08:57.690 --> 00:08:59.180
I attack with my king!

00:09:01.340 --> 00:09:03.520
Damage trigger check!

00:09:03.520 --> 00:09:07.450
I attack with Genocide Jack, 
boosted by Shining Lady!

00:09:08.470 --> 00:09:08.980
And also...

00:09:09.240 --> 00:09:11.880
It's being boosted by a 
fellow Nova Grappler...

00:09:11.880 --> 00:09:14.870
so another +5000 is added 
to Genocide Jack's power!

00:09:15.640 --> 00:09:17.810
That's my line...

00:09:18.520 --> 00:09:20.210
Drive trigger check!

00:09:24.730 --> 00:09:26.790
Damage trigger check!

00:09:26.790 --> 00:09:30.560
I attack with Battleriser, 
boosted by Cray Soldier! {clay or cray? ~SMP}

00:09:31.040 --> 00:09:32.920
Damage trigger check!

00:09:32.920 --> 00:09:35.070
Yes! Heal trigger!

00:09:35.070 --> 00:09:37.020
1 point of damage is healed!

00:09:38.490 --> 00:09:40.750
Not bad, not bad...

00:09:41.260 --> 00:09:43.050
Lucky me, right, Kamui?!

00:09:43.050 --> 00:09:46.180
If I hadn't gotten that heal 
trigger, it would've been 3 damage!

00:09:46.180 --> 00:09:48.270
Vanguard fights are about power!

00:09:48.270 --> 00:09:49.980
I love when you talk like that, Kamui!

00:09:49.980 --> 00:09:53.280
But really, Vanguard fights are 
about a strategy called "love"!

00:09:54.230 --> 00:09:55.980
Whatever, hurry up and go!

00:09:55.980 --> 00:09:58.670
So you're in a hurry to 
get married too, right?!

00:09:59.930 --> 00:10:01.010
Okay!

00:10:01.010 --> 00:10:04.080
I think you may have made enemies 
of half the people in this hall!

00:10:04.080 --> 00:10:06.200
Good luck, little brat!

00:10:08.380 --> 00:10:10.240
Here I go!

00:10:10.240 --> 00:10:13.500
I ride Magician Girl Kirara!

00:10:16.780 --> 00:10:20.040
A different unit than Genocide 
Jack has come into play!

00:10:20.480 --> 00:10:23.880
I call Kirara, Tough Boy and Shining Lady!

00:10:26.500 --> 00:10:27.970
Here I go!

00:10:27.970 --> 00:10:32.400
Kirara, boosted by Shining Lady, 
attacks your Genocide Jack!

00:10:34.390 --> 00:10:36.110
Drive trigger check!

00:10:39.220 --> 00:10:41.030
Damage trigger check!

00:10:42.950 --> 00:10:45.700
My attack succeeded!

00:10:45.700 --> 00:10:47.490
It's not worth celebrating over!

00:10:47.490 --> 00:10:52.180
After all, when Kirara's attack 
hits, I can do a Counterblast.

00:10:53.020 --> 00:10:54.510
Counterblast!

00:10:54.510 --> 00:10:56.570
I draw one card from the deck!

00:10:58.360 --> 00:11:00.760
Seems like you've studied a lot...

00:11:00.980 --> 00:11:02.510
That's the power of love!

00:11:02.510 --> 00:11:04.540
Let's get married, okay, Kamui?!

00:11:04.540 --> 00:11:05.820
Never!

00:11:05.820 --> 00:11:07.370
I love...

00:11:10.790 --> 00:11:13.700
You and I were made for each other, Kamui!

00:11:14.870 --> 00:11:17.650
What is it about me that 
you're so hung up on?!

00:11:18.040 --> 00:11:20.360
I've never done anything for you!

00:11:21.620 --> 00:11:23.110
Don't you remember?

00:11:23.540 --> 00:11:25.950
You saved me!

00:11:27.500 --> 00:11:29.760
That's right. It was an apple.

00:11:29.760 --> 00:11:31.930
I ate a red apple.

00:11:31.930 --> 00:11:34.610
But then, it got caught in my throat...

00:11:34.610 --> 00:11:37.340
I passed out!

00:11:37.910 --> 00:11:40.890
My brother and his friends 
couldn't do anything but cry...

00:11:41.380 --> 00:11:44.890
Then, you happened to be passing by, Kamui!

00:11:45.250 --> 00:11:47.350
...did something like that take place?

00:11:47.350 --> 00:11:49.460
After finding out what happened...

00:11:49.460 --> 00:11:52.970
you gently put your arms around 
me, helped me up, and kissed me!

00:11:53.740 --> 00:11:55.090
And then...

00:11:55.090 --> 00:11:58.110
with the poison apple removed, I woke up...

00:11:58.110 --> 00:11:59.930
Wait a second!!

00:12:00.470 --> 00:12:02.440
That's Snow White!

00:12:02.440 --> 00:12:04.470
And quit it with the pirate fairies, too!

00:12:04.470 --> 00:12:07.080
Have you forgotten our kiss?

00:12:07.300 --> 00:12:09.840
That never happened, especially the kiss!

00:12:09.840 --> 00:12:11.070
Prince Kamui!

00:12:11.070 --> 00:12:13.500
Accept Princess Nagisa's love!

00:12:13.500 --> 00:12:14.730
Hear! Hear!

00:12:14.730 --> 00:12:16.960
Clam it, fairy trio! You 
know how I really feel!

00:12:16.960 --> 00:12:18.380
How he really feels...?

00:12:18.380 --> 00:12:22.310
Nagisa really loves Kamui, huh?

00:12:22.310 --> 00:12:24.750
I may be a little envious!

00:12:24.750 --> 00:12:26.090
Hear that?

00:12:27.020 --> 00:12:30.030
Miss Emi is the one that I love...

00:12:32.600 --> 00:12:35.850
Nagisa... I'm gonna kick your butt!

00:12:35.850 --> 00:12:38.480
No matter what, I'm gonna win this match!

00:12:51.350 --> 00:12:55.300
This is the Vanguard championship 
regional tournament hall!

00:12:55.300 --> 00:12:59.040
At this tournament, a great number 
of awesome fights have played out,

00:12:59.040 --> 00:13:00.780
but we're down to the final fight!

00:13:00.780 --> 00:13:04.010
Team Handsome versus Team Q4!

00:13:04.470 --> 00:13:08.070
In the first match, it's Kamui 
Katsuragi versus Nagisa Daimonji!

00:13:08.070 --> 00:13:11.140
And so far, they're about neck and neck!

00:13:12.020 --> 00:13:13.420
It's my turn!

00:13:18.290 --> 00:13:21.600
I ride Mr. Invincible!

00:13:25.430 --> 00:13:26.570
Soulcharge!

00:13:26.570 --> 00:13:30.880
When Invincible is the Vanguard, I send 
the top card from my deck to my Soul,

00:13:30.880 --> 00:13:33.170
then unflip one card from my Damage Zone!

00:13:33.590 --> 00:13:35.290
Battleriser exits the field!

00:13:35.290 --> 00:13:37.310
In exchange, I call King of Sword!

00:13:37.620 --> 00:13:40.130
And then I call Tough Boy!

00:13:40.650 --> 00:13:44.680
I attack your Kirara with my 
King, boosted by Cray Soldier!

00:13:44.680 --> 00:13:46.810
I guard with Shining Lady!

00:13:49.380 --> 00:13:53.600
In that case, I attack with 
Invincible, boosted by Shining Lady!

00:13:55.930 --> 00:13:58.120
Twin drive! First...

00:13:58.120 --> 00:13:59.120
Second!

00:14:00.810 --> 00:14:02.650
Damage trigger check!

00:14:03.310 --> 00:14:04.380
Next...

00:14:04.380 --> 00:14:07.240
I attack with my King, boosted by Tough Boy!

00:14:07.990 --> 00:14:09.700
Damage trigger check!

00:14:13.660 --> 00:14:16.120
They each have 4 damage.

00:14:16.120 --> 00:14:18.520
They're both playing pretty well.

00:14:18.520 --> 00:14:20.540
I mean, not at my level, but...

00:14:20.740 --> 00:14:24.640
That's right. You <i>are</i> the King 
of Vanguard, right, Lose-umi?

00:14:24.640 --> 00:14:26.870
Oh! That sounds pretty cool...

00:14:26.870 --> 00:14:29.550
Hey! My name's Katsumi!

00:14:33.370 --> 00:14:35.770
I'm gonna marry you, Kamui!

00:14:39.360 --> 00:14:41.940
I ride Invincible!

00:14:45.530 --> 00:14:47.110
The same as me again?!

00:14:47.110 --> 00:14:48.410
Soulcharge!

00:14:51.910 --> 00:14:53.880
I call Hungry Dumpty!

00:14:53.880 --> 00:14:58.030
With that card's skill, I unflip 
one card from the Damage Zone!

00:14:58.030 --> 00:15:01.030
All of the cards in the 
Damage Zone are face up...

00:15:01.030 --> 00:15:02.900
I call Lucky Girl!

00:15:02.900 --> 00:15:05.710
I attack with Kirara, boosted by Tough Boy!

00:15:09.180 --> 00:15:10.970
Damage trigger check!

00:15:11.210 --> 00:15:12.630
Stand trigger!

00:15:12.630 --> 00:15:14.420
I give the power to Invincible!

00:15:14.420 --> 00:15:15.970
My King stands!

00:15:15.970 --> 00:15:17.840
Kirara's Counterblast!

00:15:19.560 --> 00:15:23.120
If he takes 1 more damage...

00:15:23.120 --> 00:15:24.480
Kamui the Great...

00:15:24.810 --> 00:15:26.530
Nagisa is playing incredibly well!

00:15:26.530 --> 00:15:28.060
But so is Kamui...

00:15:28.520 --> 00:15:31.920
That's right. It's a nice fight, Kamui.

00:15:31.920 --> 00:15:32.950
Stay cool.

00:15:35.070 --> 00:15:38.330
I attack with Invincible, 
boosted by Shining Lady!

00:15:38.330 --> 00:15:40.920
I guard with Ring Girl Kirara!

00:15:44.750 --> 00:15:47.330
Just a little more, Nagisa!

00:15:47.330 --> 00:15:49.270
Twin drive, first...

00:15:49.590 --> 00:15:50.760
Second...

00:15:50.760 --> 00:15:52.590
Critical trigger!

00:15:52.590 --> 00:15:55.640
I give the power and the +1 
critical to Hungry Dumpty!

00:15:56.150 --> 00:15:58.250
Their emotions are affecting 
the way they play.

00:15:58.690 --> 00:16:01.250
Even though they're equally 
matched as Cardfighters...

00:16:01.250 --> 00:16:04.230
Yeah. Katsuragi's not making 
any mistakes either.

00:16:04.460 --> 00:16:08.370
I attack with Hungry Dumpty, 
boosted by Lucky Girl!

00:16:10.480 --> 00:16:12.780
I guard with Hungry Dumpty!

00:16:18.240 --> 00:16:20.530
Yes! He protected me!

00:16:20.530 --> 00:16:21.760
Yeahhh!

00:16:21.760 --> 00:16:22.990
Close!

00:16:23.930 --> 00:16:26.910
Go for it, Nagisa! Love is power!

00:16:26.910 --> 00:16:28.840
M-Morikawa...

00:16:35.050 --> 00:16:37.020
Good luck, Kamui.

00:16:38.460 --> 00:16:40.600
I stand and draw.

00:16:41.960 --> 00:16:42.680
There it is!

00:16:43.960 --> 00:16:46.680
With a mane of courage and a roar of justice,

00:16:46.680 --> 00:16:49.930
I ride the King of the Lions, Lion Heat!  {Can't find this card name on either spreadsheet.  I'm wondering whether it should have the "the" in it, since the King of Sword and Queen of Hearts don't?}

00:16:54.490 --> 00:16:56.400
I'm gonna win it this turn!

00:16:56.400 --> 00:16:57.990
Brace yourself, Nagisa!

00:16:57.990 --> 00:16:59.960
With a boost from my Cray Soldier,

00:16:59.960 --> 00:17:02.250
my King attacks your Invincible!

00:17:02.650 --> 00:17:04.960
You're the one who should 
brace yourself, Kamui!

00:17:05.260 --> 00:17:07.460
I guard with Shining Lady!

00:17:07.660 --> 00:17:08.950
I'm not done yet!

00:17:08.950 --> 00:17:12.380
I attack with Lion Heat, 
boosted by Shining Lady!

00:17:12.600 --> 00:17:13.880
We're getting married!

00:17:14.110 --> 00:17:16.270
I guard with Twin Blader!

00:17:19.180 --> 00:17:21.040
His shield is...

00:17:21.040 --> 00:17:21.830
Zero!

00:17:22.430 --> 00:17:25.040
I activate Twin Blader's skill!

00:17:25.040 --> 00:17:27.560
If I discard one Nova Grappler from my hand,

00:17:27.560 --> 00:17:30.530
I won't take any damage for this attack!

00:17:34.210 --> 00:17:36.030
I forgot about that skill...

00:17:36.030 --> 00:17:37.930
Twin drive, first...

00:17:38.230 --> 00:17:39.340
Second...

00:17:39.340 --> 00:17:40.700
Critical trigger!

00:17:40.900 --> 00:17:44.440
I give the power and the +1 critical 
to my King, who hasn't attacked yet!

00:17:45.240 --> 00:17:47.720
If his attack succeeds, I'll beat her!

00:17:47.720 --> 00:17:52.050
It's a "Goodbye, Wedding" attack 
from my King, boosted by Tough Boy!

00:17:52.050 --> 00:17:55.270
No matter what you say, 
we're getting married!

00:17:55.790 --> 00:17:58.060
I guard with Twin Blader!

00:17:58.060 --> 00:17:59.460
I activate his skill!

00:18:01.540 --> 00:18:03.020
She blocked it...

00:18:03.360 --> 00:18:04.690
I don't believe it...

00:18:04.690 --> 00:18:06.630
There's gonna be a wedding, Kamui!

00:18:06.630 --> 00:18:09.450
Th-The fight's not over yet!

00:18:17.180 --> 00:18:19.670
I stand and draw!

00:18:19.990 --> 00:18:21.070
Yesss!

00:18:21.070 --> 00:18:23.580
With a mane of courage and a roar of justice,

00:18:23.580 --> 00:18:26.950
I ride the King of the Lions, Lion Heat! {if the above was changed, fix this for consistency}

00:18:32.330 --> 00:18:34.850
I wanna have our wedding 
at a beautiful castle!

00:18:34.850 --> 00:18:37.860
I attack with Kirara, boosted by Tough Boy!  {actually, I need a ruling here; in katakana, her name is "Kirara", but name isn't in my Japanese glossary (in English). On an English fan site, though, it's listed as "Kirara" (Magician Girl Kirara). So is it "Kirara" or "Kirara"?}

00:18:37.860 --> 00:18:39.520
I ain't goin' to any castle!

00:18:39.520 --> 00:18:41.200
I guard with Shining Lady!

00:18:41.200 --> 00:18:43.830
I'm gonna wear a frilly wedding dress!

00:18:43.830 --> 00:18:47.770
I attack with Hungry Dumpty, 
boosted by Lucky Girl!

00:18:47.770 --> 00:18:49.490
I ain't wearin' any dress!

00:18:49.490 --> 00:18:51.520
I guard with Queen of Hearts!

00:18:51.520 --> 00:18:54.440
Let's make a vow to love 
each other for eternity!

00:18:54.440 --> 00:18:58.240
I attack with Lion Heat, 
boosted by Shining Lady!

00:18:58.470 --> 00:19:00.000
I ain't vowin' anything!

00:19:00.000 --> 00:19:03.110
I intercept with two King of Swords!

00:19:03.110 --> 00:19:05.240
They'll protect me, as long 
as she doesn't draw a trigger!

00:19:05.440 --> 00:19:07.010
Rice shower!

00:19:07.010 --> 00:19:09.040
Twin drive, first...

00:19:09.040 --> 00:19:09.950
Yes!

00:19:09.950 --> 00:19:11.140
Virgin road!  {Is that *really* what she says here?  O_o}

00:19:11.140 --> 00:19:12.260
Second!

00:19:12.260 --> 00:19:13.760
Wedding cake!

00:19:13.760 --> 00:19:15.180
Stand trigger!

00:19:16.660 --> 00:19:19.990
I give the power to Lion 
Heat and Kirara stands!

00:19:22.900 --> 00:19:26.200
N-No way am I gettin' married...

00:19:26.200 --> 00:19:27.480
Everything's on this!

00:19:27.480 --> 00:19:29.360
Damage trigger check!

00:19:29.360 --> 00:19:31.230
I did it! Heal trigger!

00:19:31.230 --> 00:19:34.190
I add +5000 to the power of Lion Heat!

00:19:34.190 --> 00:19:36.940
And then I heal 1 point of damage!

00:19:37.840 --> 00:19:39.000
Yes!

00:19:39.000 --> 00:19:43.750
Now, even if Kirara attacks once more, 
she won't get past Lion Heat...

00:19:43.750 --> 00:19:46.800
Oh, no! There's no escape, Kamui!

00:19:47.900 --> 00:19:53.460
When Lion Heat attacks a Vanguard, 
you can do a Counterblast.

00:19:54.680 --> 00:19:56.850
I totally forgot!

00:19:56.850 --> 00:19:59.090
Tough Boy stands!

00:19:59.640 --> 00:20:01.930
Now, the exchange of rings!

00:20:01.930 --> 00:20:04.940
I attack with Kirara, boosted by Tough Boy!

00:20:08.570 --> 00:20:10.440
Wedding hold!  {Is what she's saying "hold"?  It sounds kinda like it may be something else, like maybe "sword," which might make slightly more sense -- if Kirara had a sword, rather than a wand, that is.  It's slightly confusing.  Anyway, if this is from the script, I'm sure it's correct.}

00:20:24.680 --> 00:20:28.030
This isn't quite what I had in mind...

00:20:28.030 --> 00:20:30.390
But maybe this isn't so bad...

00:20:31.480 --> 00:20:32.700
Miss Emi?

00:20:38.660 --> 00:20:41.880
Nagisa Daimonji is the 
winner of the first match!

00:20:42.640 --> 00:20:44.040
Goal in!

00:20:44.380 --> 00:20:48.230
You're strong and cute, Nagisa!

00:20:48.230 --> 00:20:49.180
She did it!

00:20:49.180 --> 00:20:50.690
Ka-booom!

00:20:52.830 --> 00:20:53.950
Kamui...

00:20:54.980 --> 00:20:56.900
He had the best possible defense...

00:20:57.170 --> 00:21:02.350
But he couldn't beat Nagisa's 
luck with pulling triggers.

00:21:03.600 --> 00:21:06.330
Thank you for everything, Goddess.

00:21:06.920 --> 00:21:10.420
GB... Goodbye.

00:21:10.420 --> 00:21:12.820
I learned something important here today.

00:21:12.820 --> 00:21:15.220
Love is something you fight for!

00:21:15.220 --> 00:21:17.810
Kourin!!

00:21:17.810 --> 00:21:21.150
Let's have a Vanguard fight and goal in!

00:21:21.150 --> 00:21:23.000
Don't be so hyper!

00:21:23.000 --> 00:21:26.200
Kourin, some weirdo is calling your name.

00:21:26.200 --> 00:21:28.140
<i>Him</i> again?!

00:21:28.140 --> 00:21:30.520
Kourin!

00:21:30.520 --> 00:21:32.840
Morikawa, you're embarrassing me...

00:21:34.270 --> 00:21:36.550
This looks like it could get interesting...

00:21:37.630 --> 00:21:39.070
I lost...

00:21:39.070 --> 00:21:41.350
My marriage to Miss Emi is...

00:21:42.460 --> 00:21:43.860
Kamui...

00:21:43.860 --> 00:21:46.050
Like you promised, let's get married.

00:21:46.420 --> 00:21:49.240
Come on, let's seal it with a kiss!

00:21:52.060 --> 00:21:54.610
Congratulations, my little brother!

00:21:54.610 --> 00:21:56.220
No way!

00:21:56.220 --> 00:21:57.750
Kamui!

00:21:58.020 --> 00:21:59.490
Noooooo!

00:21:59.490 --> 00:22:01.540
Kamui!

00:22:02.970 --> 00:22:05.520
Ah, youth, ka-booom!

00:22:05.520 --> 00:22:07.510
Looks like they're having fun!

00:22:08.060 --> 00:22:10.340
The best fights are the fun ones.

00:22:11.530 --> 00:22:14.570
Right? Let's have a fun fight!

00:22:14.570 --> 00:22:16.430
Yeah...

00:23:51.040 --> 00:23:53.630
I'm responsible for whether 
we win or lose...?

00:23:53.630 --> 00:23:55.320
Please win, Brother!

00:23:55.320 --> 00:23:57.990
Your future and mine are 
riding on this match!

00:23:57.990 --> 00:23:59.580
Be that as it may,

00:23:59.580 --> 00:24:02.620
until this last match, you and Kai kept 
winning, so I don't know if I'm mentally prepared...

00:24:02.850 --> 00:24:05.390
Yeah, you're right. Forget what I said.

00:24:05.390 --> 00:24:08.560
I was just talking nonsense. 
A dream! Silliness!

00:24:08.560 --> 00:24:10.340
Anyway, Kai's fight is before mine...

00:24:10.800 --> 00:24:13.000
Next time: Hidden Message!

00:24:13.000 --> 00:24:16.210
Huh? Kai wants to tell me something.

00:24:16.060 --> 00:24:18.010
Look at my fight and picture it!
